# Dopamine STP Decision Circuit
# Evidence population drives two competing choice populations with mutual inhibition.

Define a network named dopamine_stp_decision with timestep 0.0022.
# Network with 1 input, 3 LIF neurons, 4 linear transforms, 1 output.
# flow: input → evidence → choice_A → output
#        evidence → choice_B
#        (mutual inhibition: choice_A ⇄ choice_B)

# Layers:
Define an input port named input with shape (12,).
Define a LIF neuron named evidence with time constant 0.02, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 1.0.
Define a linear transformation named w_evidence_choice_A with weight matrix shape (12, 12) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 42.
Define a linear transformation named w_evidence_choice_B with weight matrix shape (12, 12) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 43.
Define a LIF neuron named choice_A with time constant 0.025, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 0.9.
Define a linear transformation named w_choice_A_choice_B with weight matrix shape (12, 12).
# inhibitory connection (weights will be negative) — zero-initialised intentionally
Define a LIF neuron named choice_B with time constant 0.025, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 0.9.
Define a linear transformation named w_choice_B_choice_A with weight matrix shape (12, 12).
# inhibitory connection (weights will be negative) — zero-initialised intentionally
Define an output port named output with shape (12,).

# Connections:
input connects to evidence.
evidence connects to w_evidence_choice_A.
w_evidence_choice_A connects to choice_A.
evidence connects to w_evidence_choice_B.
w_evidence_choice_B connects to choice_B.
choice_A connects to output.

# recurrent: choice_A ↺ choice_B
choice_A connects to w_choice_A_choice_B.
w_choice_A_choice_B connects to choice_B.
choice_B connects to w_choice_B_choice_A.
w_choice_B_choice_A connects to choice_A.

# Note: STP (facilitation on evidence→choice_A, depression on evidence→choice_B),
# homeostasis (18 Hz), and dopamine neuromodulation (×1.4) are dropped — not representable in NIR.
# Future extension: encode as metadata on weight and population nodes.
